  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/sales-bookings">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Enterprise Sales Bookings Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">OWL 2 ontology for sales bookings and revenue analytics generated from the DI Glossary Creator Agent output. The Business Process, Metrics &amp; Relationships document could not be retrieved from the repository, so ontology content is derived from the glossary only and includes validation warnings as source-traceable annotations.</rdfs:comment>
